  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Liberia Multi-Partner Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Liberia Multi-Partner Trust Fund (LMPTF), launched in 2019, helps development stakeholders holistically embed Sustainable Development Goal (SDG) approaches and targets into national plans and policies. In doing so, the government ensures continued progress in consolidating peace, embracing inclusive development practices, and creating locally owned programmes and processes.</narrative>
  </description>
